  printf("  Goal: Prove that CURLU_URLENCODE behaves differently\n");
  printf("        depending on CURLU_APPENDQUERY.\n");
  printf("========================================================\n\n");

  /*
   * This is our control test. No encoding.
   * We expect "a=b&c=d" to be appended as-is.
